direction_16 = location "Lich" about "Lich\nResurrected corpse of a mage slain in battle against Pathos; practices powerful magic" found "Caluga Valley vicinity" at 1328 1830 in zone 2
direction_17 = location "Lich" about "Lich\nResurrected corpse of a mage slain in battle against Pathos; practices powerful magic" found "Caluga Valley vicinity" at 630 262 in zone 1

On offer
    If player is karus
        Show quest "I feel it... They are resurrecting... Any true knights of Karus  must go immediately to the Plains of Silence!! And STOP THEM! Their strength will overwhelm Karus if they are not put down. Do so. Now.\n\n                - Archmage Drake."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "(Monologue)... Must stop their resurrection in the Ruins of Kalia Village!!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I feel it... They are resurrecting... Any true knights of El Morad  must go immediately to the  Ruins of Kalia Village!! And stop their resurrection! Their strength will overwhelm El Morad if they are not put down. Do so. Now.\n\n                - Archmage Drake."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "(Monologue) The Leech's resurrecting in... The Plains of Silence. It's southwest from here."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_17
    If player is elmorad
        Say "(Monologue) The Leech's resurrecting in... The Ruins of Kalia Village It's northeast from here."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_16
